About getting pregnant.

616
00:38:13,740 --> 00:38:16,460
The thing is...

617
00:38:16,540 --> 00:38:17,860
I mean, you know,

618
00:38:17,900 --> 00:38:20,700
I've been...
really happy with Ray.

619
