And now it turns out
there was a reason.

620
00:38:30,060 --> 00:38:32,100
There was a reason
I couldn't conceive.

621
00:38:36,980 --> 00:38:38,020
You're lucky, Laura.

622
00:38:38,060 --> 00:38:40,220
I don't think you
can call yourself a woman

623
