Yes ?

767
00:48:18,780 --> 00:48:20,860
Clarissa, it's Louis.

768
00:48:20,940 --> 00:48:22,340
Louis Waters.

769
00:48:22,380 --> 00:48:25,140
Louis ? Oh, my God.

770
00:48:25,220 --> 00:48:26,100
You're early.

771
00:48:26,180 --> 00:48:27,100
Do you mind ?

772
00:48:27,180 --> 00:48:28,700
Is it all right ?

773
